namespace latin:/❚

fixmeta ?SetFOL❚

// TODO:
	- rework this file (letters, precs, ...)
	- think about whether this has to be dependent on ZF
	- check whether everything is right
	- check if I need to formalize some more
	- check if I formalized unnecessary stuff
